# The screenshots each agent took while looking at its own work.
#
# They are evidence, and they are also 1.3 MB of derived bytes that can be
# regenerated by running the game and pointing tools/looking/look.mjs at it. What
# has to survive is the source, the sentence each agent was given, and the record
# in README.md — none of which is a picture.
#
# Not added to any game's own .gitignore, because editing a game is the one thing
# this directory does not do.
*/.look/
*/.look-evening/
*/.look2/
node_modules/
dist/
